<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CNB-120 index falls 1.9 points to 912.0.</title>
<headline>Czech CNB-120 index falls 1.9 points to 912.0.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The CNB-120 index, a broad daily measure of Czech equities, fell 1.9 points on Monday to 912.0, the Czech National Bank (CNB) said.</p>
<p>Seven of the ten sectoral indices lost, with the machinery index losing most, down 25.1 points to 1,212.6.</p>
<p>Three indices rose, with the banking index rising the most, up 14 points to 1,336.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
